stream or mainstream."},{"q":"Where is the datasheet?","a":"Download the official Advanced Instrumentations PDF on this page (model PM-2000XL)."},{"q":"How do I get a quote?","a":"Provide exact model (PM-2000XL), clinical area and intended applications (Per manufacturer indication and hospital evaluation.); IME confirms availability, datasheet and terms in Colombia."},{"q":"Where can I download the Pre-hospital Transport Monitor datasheet?","a":"On this page, with the “Download datasheet” button: it is the official Advanced Instrumentations PDF (in Spanish)."}],"seo_keywords_es":["monitor portátil multiparámetro","monitor PM-2000XL","monitor de paciente portátil","monitor Advanced","monitor de signos vitales Colombia","ficha técnica PM-2000XL","Sistema de monitorización PM-2000XL","Sistema de monitorización PM-2000XL Advanced Instrumentations","PM-2000XL Colombia","equipo médico IME"],"seo_keywords_en":["portable multiparameter monitor","PM-2000XL monitor","portable patient monitor","Advanced monitor","vital signs monitor Colombia","PM-2000XL datasheet","PM-2000XL monitoring system","PM-2000XL monitoring system Advanced Instrumentations","PM-2000XL Colombia","IME medical equipment"],"ficha_fabricante":{"fabricante":"Advanced Instrumentations","idioma":"es","url_origen":"https://www.i-me.com.co","descargada":"2026-10-18","sin_pdf":false}}$j$::jsonb
