 have?","a":"Eight functions, according to the manufacturer datasheet."},{"q":"Does it have a backup battery?","a":"Yes, it includes a backup battery and runs on AC 100/240 V."},{"q":"What are its dimensions?","a":"Overall 84\" x 41\" (2133 mm x 1041 mm); bed surface 76\" x 35\" (1930 mm x 889 mm)."},{"q":"Where is the datasheet?","a":"Download the official Advanced Instrumentations PDF on this page (model B-1000-PRO)."},{"q":"How do I get a quote?","a":"Provide exact model (B-1000-PRO), clinical area and intended applications (Inpatient care; Medical care); IME confirms availability, datasheet and terms in Colombia."},{"q":"Where can I download the Articulating Electric Hospital Bed datasheet?","a":"On this page, with the “Download datasheet” button: it is the official Advanced Instrumentations PDF (in Spanish)."}],"seo_keywords_es":["cama hospitalaria eléctrica","cama eléctrica B-1000 Pro","cama de hospital 8 funciones","cama hospitalaria Advanced","cama hospitalaria Colombia","ficha técnica B-1000 Pro","Cama hospitalaria eléctrica B-1000 Pro","Cama hospitalaria eléctrica B-1000 Pro Advanced Instrumentations","ficha técnica B-1000-PRO","B-1000-PRO Colombia"],"seo_keywords_en":["electric hospital bed","B-1000 Pro electric bed","8-function hospital bed","Advanced hospital bed","hospital bed Colombia","B-1000 Pro datasheet","B-1000 Pro electric hospital bed","B-1000 Pro electric hospital bed Advanced Instrumentations","B-1000-PRO datasheet","B-1000-PRO Colombia"],"ficha_fabricante":{"fabricante":"Advanced Instrumentations","idioma":"es","url_origen":"https://www.i-me.com.co","descargada":"2026-10-18","sin_pdf":false}}$j$::jsonb
